### 1 Chronicles 12:1
**Q1. To where did the mighty men come to David while he kept himself close because of Saul?**
**Answer:** To Ziklag.
**Verse:** 1 Chronicles 12:1

**Q2. Why was David keeping himself close?**
**Answer:** Because of Saul the son of Kish.
**Verse:** 1 Chronicles 12:1

**Q3. Who were the men that came to David at Ziklag?**
